{"id":"ozy4k8afef43y6sn9cpumquum","title":"Ted Sanders 解释 OpenAI 模型命名规则","originalTitle":"Quoting Ted Sanders","summary":"OpenAI 的模型命名规则显示版本号不仅代表发布顺序，还反映与其它版本的关系及改进程度。例如，6.1 版本表示它是在 5.6 版本之后发布，与其它 6.1 版本在训练数据和个性上有相似之处，但改进幅度不足以成为 7.0 版本。","reason":null,"source":{"name":"Simon Willison"},"links":{"original":"https://simonwillison.net/2026/Oct/28/ted-sanders/"},"publishedAt":"2026-10-28T23:23:21.000Z","discoveredAt":"2026-10-29T00:15:30.216Z","timelineAt":"2026-10-29T00:15:30.216Z","category":"opinion","tags":["大佬观点","模型发布","OpenAI"],"score":28,"selected":false,"channel":"news","story":{"publicId":"daf119c3-e607-4fae-9284-83f0816ede06","title":"OpenAI模型命名规则及版本关系说明"},"x":null,"readingMode":"full","author":null,"body":null,"outline":[],"relatedStories":[{"publicId":"daf119c3-e607-4fae-9284-83f0816ede06","title":"OpenAI模型命名规则及版本关系说明"}],"topics":[{"slug":"openai","name":"OpenAI / ChatGPT"},{"slug":"model-releases","name":"模型发布"},{"slug":"opinions","name":"大佬观点"}],"indexable":false,"markdownAvailable":true,"group":{"factId":"fUSTg4u18uAA","reportCount":1,"additionalSourceCount":0},"hasTranslation":false,"bodyLanguage":"original"}